{"additions":2,"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Changes since v0.17.0\n\n- #202 GitHub: show a PR's changed files and diff in a full-width window (`d`, `gh pr diff`, a page stack, the `window \"diff\"` block) (closes #200)\n- #203 GitHub: open a pull request as a worktree (`W`: after a confirmation, `git fetch refs/pull/N/head` + `git worktree add`; `worktree-dir` / `worktree-name` / `worktree-branch`) (closes #201)\n- #205 Git view and the diff window: `o` / `O` open the selected file with an app; the diff window's browser key moves to `b` (closes #204)\n- #199 Bump rustls from 0.23.36 to 0.23.46 (Dependabot)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01N7wFSHbpTzvkK6WS1CRS7b","changedFiles":2,"comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-10-23T10:49:26Z","deletions":2,"headRefName":"release/0.18.0","isDraft":false,"labels":[],"number":206,"reviewDecision":"","reviewRequests":[],"reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDORNPWJs8AAAABT2iHKg","author":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### 🟢 Approval recommended\n\nThe two version updates are consistent, and the complete diff contains no unresolved issues.\n\n**No open issues** 🎉\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nPrepares vig v0.18.0 for release, covering the previously merged PR diff window, PR worktree support, and file-opening features. This PR only updates release version metadata.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Bumps the package version from `0.17.0` to `0.18.0`.\n- Keeps the lockfile’s vig version aligned; no functional or dependency changes are introduced.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| `Cargo.toml` | Sets the package version to `0.18.0`. |\r\n| `Cargo.lock` | Updates the vig package entry to `0.18.0`. |\n</details>\n\n<sub>Review effort: Balanced</sub>","submittedAt":"2026-10-23T10:50:50Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"reactionGroups":[],"state":"COMMENTED","commit":{"oid":"97b0a799bf1664ad3aadc91f864857230d338878"}}],"state":"MERGED","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:53:48Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39941801710/job/120374778405","name":"build (x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-latest)","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:49:33Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:50:14Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39941801583/job/120374778177","name":"lint","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:49:33Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:54:43Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39942379819/job/120376693222","name":"create-tag","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:54:34Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:52:45Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39941801710/job/120374778926","name":"build (aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu, ubuntu-24.04-arm)","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:49:35Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:54:17Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39941801710/job/120374778876","name":"build (aarch64-apple-darwin, macos-latest)","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:49:34Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:54:17Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/td72/vig/actions/runs/39941801710/job/120376605324","name":"upload","startedAt":"2026-10-23T10:54:17Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Build"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-23T10:54:31Z","conclusion":"SKIPPED","detailsUrl"